  "doc": {
    "description": "Conditional-operator matrix: every when-condition operator at flatten time.\n\nA 6-lane generator where each lane's structure is chosen by a distinct\nrelational/boolean operator over the loop index i (1..6). Exactly one\nwhen-branch fires per lane, selecting that lane's source:\n\n    i == 1            -> P     (equality)\n    i != 1 && i < 3   -> Q     (inequality, less-than, boolean AND)\n    i >= 3 && i <= 4  -> P     (ge, le)\n    i > 4 || i == 99  -> Q     (gt, boolean OR)\n\nThe operators are compile-time only (shdl.md §13, §7.7); they never\nbecome gates. Each lane ORs its chosen source with a shared GND (0) so\nOR(src, 0) = src is observable after one cycle. Out (LSB-first) =\n[P, Q, P, P, Q, Q].",
    "source": "circuit.shdl",
    "flattened_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
  },
